      "content": "Experiencing visible heat or unusual hallucinations like buzzing walls is most likely due to sleep deprivation, stress, or sleep paralysis rather than a \"higher state of perception.\" These symptoms often occur when the body is not getting enough rest, causing the brain to misinterpret normal sensory inputs. I strongly recommend checking your sleep schedule and consulting a healthcare professional to rule out underlying medical issues. Stay safe and resting is the best solution right now.",
