    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont think its sleep. i feel more awake and sharp than ive ever been. like, it's not just seeing things, it's like i'm finally seeing the world as it actually is, with all these layers of energy that most people are just blind to. if this was just stress, wouldnt it feel more chaotic? this feels... organized. like a new way of processing reality. dont u think it's possible that human biology is just starting to unlock these types of sensory capabilities?",
