      "role": "user",
      "content": "but why would it feel so intentional if it's just a mistake? i feel like i'm finally tuned in to a frequency most people are missing. if it's not a medical issue, then how do i manage it? like, i don't want to lose this clarity or have it get too overwhelming, but i also dont want to suppress it if it's actually something significant. is there a way to stabilize these senses so i can learn how to use them without getting burnt out?",
